## What to deliver

Build the Lanternjaw sprite sheet up operation by operation until each
`frames/<index>.png` matches the brief and that frame's target: a dark anglerfish
predator with a glowing amber lure drawn in each of its 32×32 frames — swimming
down, up, left, and right (two frames each), and the lure-bob animation. When you
are satisfied, stop: the recorded per-frame action logs are your finished
submission.
